# Fallback ignore for builds run from the repo root. The decoupled pipelines no
# longer build from here — base images use images/<name>/ as their context and the
# runtime images use stage/<variant>/ (just application.jar), so each context is
# already tiny. This list still applies if you `docker build .` from the root
# (e.g. ad-hoc experiments), keeping the context small and reproducible.
.git
target
stage
.idea
*.iml
scripts
images
k8s
mise.toml
*.md
